flowchart LR
  Repo["Project repository"] -->|Push / Repository event| GitHub["GitHub App"]
  GitHub -->|Signed webhook| Gate["Cloudflare Worker webhook gate"]
  Gate -->|HMAC valid| Auth["App JWT to read-only installation token"]
  Auth --> Scan["Repository and publish manifest scan"]
  Scan --> Filter["Allowlist, Evidence URL, fork and archive filter"]
  Filter -->|Complete snapshot| KV["Workers KV portfolio:index"]
  KV --> API["Public projects.json and health"]
  API --> Dashboard["Baby2B portfolio Dashboard"]
  Static["Reviewed static project index"] --> Dashboard
  Cron["Cloudflare Cron every 30 minutes"] --> Scan
  Gate -->|Invalid signature / oversized body| Reject["Reject and log category only"]
  Scan -->|GitHub or parse failure| Keep["Keep last-known-good KV snapshot"]
  Keep --> API

  subgraph Private["Private trust boundary"]
    Auth
    Scan
  end

  subgraph Public["Public data boundary"]
    KV
    API
    Dashboard
  end
